(Giriş)
Bismillah ir-Rahman ir-Rahim
Ya Rabb, qalbi yastafidu min noorika
Wa ruhi yatamallal bi rahmatika

(Kıta 1)
Amantu bika ya Rabb, tawakkaltu ‘alayk
Al-huzn yanfadi, al-farah yantashir
Kalbi saakin fi dhikrika
Ya Allah, nuruka yaghshi qulubana

(Nakarat)
Hasbiyallahu, la ilaha illa Hu
Hasbiyallahu, qalbi ya‘lamu Hu
Subhanallah, Alhamdulillah
Allahu Akbar, Ya Allah…

(2 kez tekrar)

(Kıta 2)
Ya Ghafoor, rahmatuka wasi‘a
Ayadi maftuha ilayka wahdaka
Ruhiyu tataharrak fi sujud
Kalbi yarju fadlaka ya Rabb

(Nakarat – Coşkulu)
Hasbiyallahu, la ilaha illa Hu
Hasbiyallahu, qalbi ya‘lamu Hu
Subhanallah, Alhamdulillah
Allahu Akbar, Ya Allah…

(2 kez tekrar)

(Çıkış)
La ilaha illa Allah
Muhammadur Rasulullah
Qalbi shahid ya Rabb
Sanatuka fi kulli shay… Subhanallah